{"seq":3,"slug":"certificate-issue-record-retention","title":"证书签发流程与单证保存（联131）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/certificate-declaration/certificate-issue-record-retention","wordCount":1672,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"证书签发流程与单证保存-联131\">证书签发流程与单证保存（联131）</h1><p>证书开出来只是起点。签发流程里每一个环节都可能出错——申请人资格、货物描述、原产标准栏、签章与编号；而开证之后真正决定企业抗风险能力的，是单证保存：核查来时拿不出当年的证据链，前面所有判定与计算的正确性都无从证明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>签发流程是一条有明确角色的链路，保存义务则是这条链路的延伸。二者共同构成「可举证能力」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[原产判定结论] --&gt; B[生成申请数据]&#10;  B --&gt; C{凭证类型}&#10;  C --&gt;|官方签发| D[签证机构审核]&#10;  C --&gt;|自主声明| E[企业自签]&#10;  D --&gt; F[签发证书 编配编号]&#10;  E --&gt; G[声明载入商业单据]&#10;  F --&gt; H[单证归集]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[按期限保存]&#10;  I --&gt; J[核查时举证]\">graph TD\n  A[原产判定结论] --&gt; B[生成申请数据]\n  B --&gt; C{凭证类型}\n  C --&gt;|官方签发| D[签证机构审核]\n  C --&gt;|自主声明| E[企业自签]\n  D --&gt; F[签发证书 编配编号]\n  E --&gt; G[声明载入商业单据]\n  F --&gt; H[单证归集]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[按期限保存]\n  I --&gt; J[核查时举证]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环节</th>\n<th>责任方</th>\n<th>关键控制点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>申请数据生成</td>\n<td>出口企业</td>\n<td>必须来自判定结论而非手工填</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资格校验</td>\n<td>企业/签证机构</td>\n<td>企业是否有该协定下的出证资格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审核签发</td>\n<td>签证机构</td>\n<td>货物描述、HS、原产标准一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编号与签章</td>\n<td>签证机构</td>\n<td>唯一编号，供进口国核验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单证归集</td>\n<td>企业</td>\n<td>证书+运输单据+原产证据齐全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期限保存</td>\n<td>企业</td>\n<td>按协定与国内法取较长者</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"申请环节\">申请环节</h2><h3 id=\"数据来源必须是判定结论\">数据来源必须是判定结论</h3><p>申请数据从判定结论生成，是保证证书与判定一致性的唯一可靠方式。手工填表会引入两类错误：原产标准栏填成另一条同义判据，或货物描述与 BOM 不一致。两者在核查时都会被视为「证书内容不实」。判定结论的生成逻辑见 <a href=\"../origin-determination-data/origin-qualification-engine\">原产地资格判定引擎与规则配置</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"出证资格校验\">出证资格校验</h3><p>并非所有企业都能对任意协定出具证书或声明。系统必须在申请前校验资格：企业是否在签证机构备案、是否取得经核准出口商资格、该协定是否接受自主声明。资格不足时应阻断并提示走官方签发路径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一证一货与合并\">一证一货与合并</h3><p>一张证书通常对应对一批出运货物。同批次多品名可以在同一证书上分行列示，但必须每行独立标注 HS 与原产标准。不要把不同原产标准、不同判据的货物混在同一行，这会让核查无法逐项验证。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;certificate_ref&quot;: &quot;CO-2026-CN-004217&quot;,&#10;  &quot;agreement&quot;: &quot;RCEP&quot;,&#10;  &quot;exporter&quot;: &quot;CN-EX-88412&quot;,&#10;  &quot;issue_authority&quot;: &quot;CCPIT-SHANGHAI&quot;,&#10;  &quot;issue_date&quot;: &quot;2026-09-20&quot;,&#10;  &quot;lines&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;no&quot;: 1,&#10;      &quot;hs6&quot;: &quot;851830&quot;,&#10;      &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Bluetooth earbuds&quot;,&#10;      &quot;origin_criterion&quot;: &quot;RVC40&quot;,&#10;      &quot;origin_country&quot;: &quot;VN&quot;,&#10;      &quot;quantity&quot;: 1200,&#10;      &quot;uom&quot;: &quot;PCS&quot;,&#10;      &quot;verdict_ref&quot;: &quot;VRD-2026-04170&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;no&quot;: 2,&#10;      &quot;hs6&quot;: &quot;851762&quot;,&#10;      &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Bluetooth adapter&quot;,&#10;      &quot;origin_criterion&quot;: &quot;CTH&quot;,&#10;      &quot;origin_country&quot;: &quot;VN&quot;,&#10;      &quot;quantity&quot;: 300,&#10;      &quot;uom&quot;: &quot;PCS&quot;,&#10;      &quot;verdict_ref&quot;: &quot;VRD-2026-04171&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;supersedes&quot;: null&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"certificate_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CO-2026-CN-004217\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"agreement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RCEP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"exporter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CN-EX-88412\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"issue_authority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CCPIT-SHANGHAI\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"issue_date\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-20\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lines\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"hs6\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"851830\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bluetooth earbuds\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"origin_criterion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RVC40\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"origin_country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"VN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"quantity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"uom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PCS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"verdict_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"VRD-2026-04170\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"hs6\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"851762\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bluetooth adapter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"origin_criterion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CTH\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"origin_country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"VN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"quantity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"uom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PCS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"verdict_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"VRD-2026-04171\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"supersedes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"审核与签发\">审核与签发</h2><h3 id=\"签证机构审什么\">签证机构审什么</h3><p>签证机构的审核集中在三处：申请人与货物信息是否与单据一致、HS 归类是否合理、原产标准是否与协定规则相符。它通常不重做完整的原产判定，因此企业提交的判定结论质量直接决定审核能否通过。</p>\n<h3 id=\"编号与防伪\">编号与防伪</h3><p>证书编号必须唯一且可被进口国核验。电子证书通常支持在线核验，进口国海关可通过编号或电子数据确认证书真实性与状态（是否已作废、是否已补发）。系统应保存证书的完整状态历史。</p>\n<h3 id=\"更正-作废与补发\">更正、作废与补发</h3><p>三种变更各有条件：<strong>更正</strong>在货物未出运或未使用时可修改重签；<strong>作废</strong>用于证书不再适用；<strong>补发</strong>用于出运后补办。补发件通常要标注补发并说明原因。三者的共同点是：原件状态必须被显式转为失效，不能出现同一批货两份有效证书并存。</p>\n<h3 id=\"变更触发重判\">变更触发重判</h3><p>任何涉及货物构成、供应商、运输路径的变更，都应触发原产重判并据此决定是否需要换证。常见错误是货已改动但沿用旧证，形成「单货不符」，这在核查中比判定错误更难辩解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单证保存义务\">单证保存义务</h2><h3 id=\"保存范围的界定\">保存范围的界定</h3><p>保存的不只是证书本身，而是支撑证书的全部证据：原产地证或声明的副本、运输单据与中转证明、供应商原产声明与长期声明、判定结论快照、以及支持区域价值成分计算的成本数据。缺少任何一类，证据链就断在那一点上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"保存期限的确定\">保存期限的确定</h3><p>期限遵循「取较长者」原则：协定约定的期限、国内法规定的期限、以及企业内部合规政策要求的期限，三者中取最长。以 USMCA 为例，进口商须自进口之日起保留进口单据与认证<strong>至少五年</strong>，出口商与生产商须在认证完成后保留证明原产的全部记录<strong>五年</strong>，且这可被要求更长；记录可用任何介质保存，只要可检索与打印（<a href=\"https://www.international.gc.ca/trade-commerce/trade-agreements-accords-commerciaux/agr-acc/cusma-aceum/text-texte/05.aspx\">CUSMA/USMCA Chapter 5</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"有效期与保存期是两回事\">有效期与保存期是两回事</h3><p>证书本身的有效期（例如进口国须在证书完成后若干年内接受）与企业的单证保存义务期限是两个不同概念。前者约束进口国海关的接受行为，后者约束企业的留存行为。混淆二者会导致「证书早过期了所以不用留」这类致命判断。</p>\n<h3 id=\"介质与可检索性\">介质与可检索性</h3><p>电子介质是允许的，前提是可检索与可打印。工程上这意味着保存系统要支持按证书编号、SKU、批次、供应商、期间多维检索，而不是把 PDF 堆在一个目录里。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE certificate_record (&#10;  certificate_ref  TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  agreement        TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  certificate_type TEXT NOT NULL,     -- &#39;CO&#39;|&#39;FORM&#39;|&#39;DECLARATION&#39;&#10;  exporter_id      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  verdict_ref      TEXT NOT NULL,     -- 指向判定结论快照&#10;  status           TEXT NOT NULL,     -- &#39;VALID&#39;|&#39;AMENDED&#39;|&#39;VOID&#39;|&#39;REISSUED&#39;&#10;  issued_at        DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  retention_until  DATE NOT NULL,     -- 按协定/国内法取较长者&#10;  storage_uri      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  evidence_manifest JSONB NOT NULL    -- 证据清单与校验和&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> certificate_record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  certificate_ref  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  agreement        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  certificate_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'CO'|'FORM'|'DECLARATION'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  exporter_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  verdict_ref      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 指向判定结论快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'VALID'|'AMENDED'|'VOID'|'REISSUED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  issued_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  retention_until  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 按协定/国内法取较长者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  storage_uri      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_manifest JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    -- 证据清单与校验和</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"证据清单与完整性\">证据清单与完整性</h2><h3 id=\"清单即校验\">清单即校验</h3><p>把证据做成清单并记录每项文件的校验和，可以在核查时证明「当时的证据是什么、有没有被改动」。这是低成本高收益的一项设计。</p>\n<h3 id=\"保存与隐私边界\">保存与隐私边界</h3><p>单证中常含价格、供应商名称、工艺细节等敏感商业信息。这些内容属于企业内部资料，其保存、导出与对外提供应遵循最小必要原则：对外只提供核查所需的具体文件，而非整包导出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>申请数据必须由判定结论生成，手工填表是证书内容不实的主要来源。</li>\n<li>出证资格需前置校验，资格不足时阻断并改走官方签发路径。</li>\n<li>更正、作废、补发三者都要求原件状态显式失效，不得两证并存。</li>\n<li>货物变更必须触发重判并按需换证，单货不符比判定错误更难辩解。</li>\n<li>保存范围覆盖证书、运输单据、供应商声明、判定快照与成本数据。</li>\n<li>保存期限取协定、国内法、内控三者较长者；有效期与保存期是不同概念。</li>\n<li>保存系统的核心能力是可按编号、SKU、批次、供应商多维检索并可打印。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"证书签发流程与单证保存（联131）","id":"证书签发流程与单证保存-联131"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"申请环节","id":"申请环节"},{"level":3,"text":"数据来源必须是判定结论","id":"数据来源必须是判定结论"},{"level":3,"text":"出证资格校验","id":"出证资格校验"},{"level":3,"text":"一证一货与合并","id":"一证一货与合并"},{"level":2,"text":"审核与签发","id":"审核与签发"},{"level":3,"text":"签证机构审什么","id":"签证机构审什么"},{"level":3,"text":"编号与防伪","id":"编号与防伪"},{"level":3,"text":"更正、作废与补发","id":"更正-作废与补发"},{"level":3,"text":"变更触发重判","id":"变更触发重判"},{"level":2,"text":"单证保存义务","id":"单证保存义务"},{"level":3,"text":"保存范围的界定","id":"保存范围的界定"},{"level":3,"text":"保存期限的确定","id":"保存期限的确定"},{"level":3,"text":"有效期与保存期是两回事","id":"有效期与保存期是两回事"},{"level":3,"text":"介质与可检索性","id":"介质与可检索性"},{"level":2,"text":"证据清单与完整性","id":"证据清单与完整性"},{"level":3,"text":"清单即校验","id":"清单即校验"},{"level":3,"text":"保存与隐私边界","id":"保存与隐私边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"直接运输/不得转运与中途展览规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/certificate-declaration/direct-transport-no-transhipment"},"next":{"title":"原产地核查/退证/补税风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/origin-verification-risk/origin-verification-recovery-tax"}}